{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05430","headline":"阳春怨 · 许景先","name":"阳春怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红树晓莺蹄，春风暖翠闺。\n雕笼熏绣被，珠履踏金堤。\n芍药花初吐，菖蒲叶正齐。\n藁砧当此日，行役向辽西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许景先","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}